WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.074
Reassuringly for practitioners,

00:00:02.154 --> 00:00:08.257
under mild conditions both fixed-momentum SGD and
standard AdaGrad converge almost surely

00:00:08.337 --> 00:00:11.175
to stationary points of non-convex losses,

00:00:11.255 --> 00:00:17.080
and momentum provably accelerates SGD, narrowing
the gap between theory and practice.
